# Suite ivsc (plan 03-07): IVSC v1 layer-1 parser (docs/formats/ivsc-v1.md). One case per
# fixture record of data/cart/*.json (positive, build and patch kinds), plus the code-built
# cases ivsc.B08-len-over-max, ivsc.X02-canonical-roundtrip and ivsc.X03-bad-args. Classes:
# P positive, B boundary, N malformed or refused, X cross-cutting; L (load) ids arrive in 03-11.
# Family fuzz (plan 03-08, tests/ivsc/ivsc_fuzz.c): eight fixed seeds of mutated positives and
# the non-vacuity case ivsc.fuzz.reasons-covered.
